    "population": "All eight positive calibration questions k01–k08 fixed before this experiment. kn1 was a negative for the old Marta-only scope but the integrated corpus covers sickness benefits. No answer generation or reranker. Each query was run once for each encoder input and once against staging. G7 and the WZON extension trial were excluded.",
